<title>USA: U.S. weekly railcar loadings--AAR.</title>
<headline>U.S. weekly railcar loadings--AAR.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Association of American Railroads reported weekly railcar loadings as follows:</p>
<p>    -		Pct Change   Week Ending:	   Year-Ago</p>
<p>    -		   In Week---12/21/96  12/14/96     Week</p>
<p> Grain		    -9.9	24,641    27,337    25,417</p>
<p> Grain Mill Products   3.0	10,163     9,865     9,278</p>
<p> Other Farm Products  -0.7	 2,568     2,586     2,314</p>
<p> Metallic Ores	  -6.2	17,977    19,171    19,394</p>
